# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in only what you need.
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL: the deterministic core (discover, orchestrate,
# preflight, build, install, updates, migrate, export, release) works with none
# of them. Secrets are read only from the environment, never hard-coded.

# ─── LLM provider (needed only by `assistant` and the `--describe` NL paths) ──
# Pick a provider explicitly; otherwise the first key found wins
# (precedence: NVIDIA → Google). Without any key, NL features degrade to the
# deterministic flow instead of failing.
# MPA_LLM_PROVIDER=nvidia        # nvidia | google | openai

# NVIDIA NIM (OpenAI-compatible). Get a key at build.nvidia.com
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini. Get a key at aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=                # accepted as an alias for GEMINI_API_KEY

# ─── Mod catalog ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Modrinth works anonymously (300 requests/minute, User-Agent required, both
# already handled). A token only raises your rate limit.
# Create one at modrinth.com/settings/pats
# MODRINTH_API_TOKEN=
